-- Historical yearly product prices (2007–2026) for the curated basket.
-- Explicit RUB fixtures per product/year (approximate, not live market data).
-- Idempotent: safe to re-run. Requires products from 02_seed.sql.

BEGIN;

INSERT INTO product_prices (product_id, year, average_price, currency)
VALUES
  -- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  -- 1998-2006: ESTIMATES, not measurements.
  --
  -- Each series is walked backward from its real 2007 price through Rosstat's
  -- headline CPI, then scaled so 1998 lands on a researched figure for that
  -- product. CPI sets the shape; the 1998 anchor sets the level, because CPI
  -- alone is wrong per-product — for potatoes it implies 3.96 RUB in 1998
  -- against an actual 2.10.
  --
  -- Confidence is uneven. Картошка 1998 is a published Rosstat figure. The
  -- imported goods (Jameson, Jacobs, Winston, Боржоми) carry a higher factor
  -- because the ruble went 6 -> 24 across 1998-99 and dollar-priced goods rose
  -- far beyond CPI. The rest are reasoned from category behaviour and should be
  -- treated as within roughly +/-50%, not as data.
  --
  -- Доширак starts 2005: Russian production began that year, and products.
  -- available_from keeps it out of earlier baskets entirely.
  -- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
